    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d301-a2">

                <pb facs="0472" n="376" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg376"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure in No. 832.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Rear-Admiral Dewey to
                        the Secretary of the Navy.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Force on Asiatic Station</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Flagship Olympia, Cavite, P.
                        I.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1898-07-27"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">July 27, 1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform the Department
                    that Mr. E. H. Rawson-Walker, Her Britannic Majesty’s consul at Manila, has
                    performed the trying duties of acting United States consul during the last three
                    months in a most able and painstaking manner and has been of invaluable
                    assistance to me, being my only means of communicating with the Spanish
                    authorities and the chief agent in the protection of foreign residents.</p>
                <p>I trust the United States Government will see fit to inform Her Britannic
                    Majesty’s foreign office of my deep appreciation of Mr. Rawson-Walker’s valuable
                    services.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">George Dewey</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Rear-Admiral, United States Navy,<lb/>Commanding U.
                            S. Naval Force on Asiatic Station.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
